    <string name="ai__consent_title">Before you use AI tools</string>
    <string name="ai__consent_body">When you tap an AI action, GenKeyboard sends the text in the field (or your selection), the action you chose and a random device ID to our server. The server passes the text to a third-party AI provider (Google Gemini, OpenRouter, xAI, OpenAI or Anthropic) to write the result. We do not store your text. Nothing is sent until you tap an action, and never from password fields or incognito mode. You can turn AI tools off at any time in Settings.</string>
